      "content": "it's not just about a bill or a call... i'm talking about the feeling of being cornered. like, i look at my life and there's just no exit. everything is closed. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise and the pressure is to just... stop being here. it feels like the only logical way to settle the score.",
